.nh
.TH umoci-list(1) # umoci list - List tags in an OCI layout
Aleksa Sarai
DECEMBER 2016

.SH "نام (NAME)"
umoci list \- List tags in an OCI layout


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBumoci list\fP
\fB--layout\fP=\fIlayout\fP

.PP
\fBumoci ls\fP
\fB--layout\fP=\fIlayout\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Gets the list of tags defined in an OCI layout, with one tag name per line. The
output order is not defined.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB--layout\fP=\fIlayout\fP
  The OCI image layout to get the list of tags from. \fIlayout\fP must be a path to
  a valid OCI layout.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
The following lists the set of tags in a layout copied from a \fBdocker\fP(1)
registry using \fBskopeo\fP(1).

.EX
% skopeo copy docker://opensuse/amd64:42.1 oci:ocidir:42.1
% skopeo copy docker://opensuse/amd64:42.2 oci:ocidir:42.2
% skopeo copy docker://opensuse/amd64:latest oci:ocidir:latest
% umoci ls --layout ocidir
42.1
42.2
latest
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBumoci\fP(1), \fBumoci-stat\fP(1)
